            {"mods.why.SHVDN_SOURCE_PENDING",new[]{"Trae scripts en código fuente (.cs / .vb): el host de scripts de GTAVXR todavía no los compila.","It ships source scripts (.cs / .vb): GTAVXR's script host does not compile them yet.","Traz scripts-fonte (.cs / .vb): o host de scripts da GTAVXR ainda não os compila."}},
